  "texts": {
    "preamble": "Stephan vs State Of Kerala on 11 September, 2024 Author: Dinesh Kumar Singh Bench: Dinesh Kumar Singh WP(C) NO. 31525 OF 2024 1 2024:KER:69561 IN THE HIGH COURT OF KERALA AT ERNAKULAM PRESENT THE HONOURABLE MR. JUSTICE DINESH KUMAR SINGH WEDNESDAY, THE 11TH DAY OF SEPTEMBER 2024 / 20TH BHADRA, 1946 WP(C) NO. 31525 OF 2024 PETITIONER: STEPHAN, AGED 64 YEARS S/O.THARIYATH, EDATTUKARAN HOUSE, KALLETTUMKARA DESOM, KALLETTUMKARA P.O, CHALAKUDY TALUK, THRISSUR DISTRICT, PIN - 680683 BY ADVS. N.L.BITTO MITHUL T ANTO RESPONDENTS: 1 STATE OF KERALA REP. BY THE SECRETARY TO THE GOVT., PUBLIC WORKS DEPARTMENT, GOVT. SECRETARIAT, THIRUVANANTHAPURAM, PIN - 695001 2 DISTRICT COLLECTOR, THRISSUR DISTRICT, COLLECTORATE, AYYANTHOLE P.O., THRISSUR DISTRICT, PIN - 680003 3 ASSISTANT ENGINEER, PWD DEPARTMENT, ROAD SECTION, IRINJALAKKUDA, THRISSUR Stephan vs State Of Kerala on 11 September, 2024 Indian Kanoon - http://indiankanoon.org/doc/71019136/ 1 DISTRICT, PIN - 680121 4 ALOOR GRAMA PANCHAYATH, REPRESENTED BY ITS SECRETARY, KALLETTUMKARA P.O, MUKUNDAPURAM TALUK, THRISSUR DISTRICT, PIN - 680684 5 HEALTH INSPECTOR, PRIMARY HEALTH CENTRE, ALOOR, THRISSUR DISTRICT, PIN - 680683 WP(C) NO. 31525 OF 2024 2 2024:KER:69561 BY ADV PHILIP T.VARGHESE SRI.S. GOPINATHAN -SR.GP THIS WRIT PETITION (CIVIL) HAVING COME UP FOR ADMISSION ON 11.09.2024, THE COURT ON THE SAME DAY DELIVERED THE FOLLOWING: WP(C) NO. 31525 OF 2024 3 2024:KER:69561 JUDGMENT Dated this the 11th day of September, 2024 The present Writ Petition has been filed impugning Ext.P2 notice for demolition of the shed allegedly constructed by encroaching the PWD road on the edge of Kallettumkara over bridge in Potta- Moonupeedika road. The petitioner is allegedly conducting the fish stall on the road as mentioned above by encroaching the public road. The road where the petitioner is conducting the fish stall is not a market and it is causing lot of inconvenience and nuisance to the general public, besides being prone to accidents. Since vehicles are parked over there, there exists a chance for accidents as well. WP(C) NO. 31525 OF 2024 2024:KER:69561 2. A violator of the law cannot come before this Court seeking the public law remedy to Stephan vs State Of Kerala on 11 September, 2024 Indian Kanoon - http://indiankanoon.org/doc/71019136/ 2 protect him from removal of encroachment of the public road.",
    "facts": "The petitioner had not replied to the said notice. The petitioner has not produced any documents authorizing him to construct the shed to put up the stall for selling fish. The petitioner has encroached upon the public road and has unauthorizedly constructed the said fish stall.",
    "arguments": ""
  },
